---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { allGuides, site } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="shell grid gap-12 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <a href="/" class="brand-link mb-5 inline-flex" aria-label={`${site.fullName}首頁`}>
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="brand-sun"></span>
          <span class="brand-wave"></span>
        </span>
        <span>
          <strong class="block text-lg tracking-[.12em] text-white">觀夕平台</strong>
        </span>
      </a>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-white/60">
        從抵達、停車到等待夕陽，整理安平海岸旅行真正需要的資訊，讓一天在海風裡安穩收尾。
      </p>
      <a
        class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#f5ab78]"
        href={site.maps.place}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        <Icon name="map" class="size-4" />
        臺南市安平區・查看位置
      </a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="footer-title">規劃旅程</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 gap-y-3">
        {
          allGuides.slice(0, 8).map((guide) => (
            <a class="footer-link" href={guide.href}>{guide.label}</a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="footer-title">旅前查詢</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <a class="footer-link" href="/sources/">資料來源與圖片授權</a>
        <a
          class="footer-link"
          href="https://www.cwa.gov.tw/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          中央氣象署
        </a>
        <a
          class="footer-link"
          href="https://2384.tainan.gov.tw/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          大台南公車
        </a>
        <a class="footer-link" href="/safety/">海邊安全提醒</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="shell flex flex-col gap-2 py-6 text-xs text-white/45 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 觀夕平台旅遊指南</p>
      <p>海況與現場告示優先，資訊異動請於出發前再次確認。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
